  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The first overtone frequency of an open organ pipe is equal to the fundamental frequency of a closed organ pipe. If the length of the closed organ pipe is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The length of the open organ pipe is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cm</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "80",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The fundamental frequency of the closed organ pipe is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>The frequency of the first overtone of a open organ pipe is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Since,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
